WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.750 line:9%
[Gentle instrumental game music]

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:07.150 line:9%
Mara walks through a riverside park
under flowering jacarandas.

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.350 line:9%
An ibis leads Mara down a wooded trail.

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:16.200 line:9%
Mara jumps over a fallen log.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.800 line:9%
Mara photographs an Australian
white ibis with her field lens.

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:22.500 line:9%
The wildlife journal records the discovery.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:26.150 line:9%
